window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>USA Today</i> best-selling author Jane Henry delivers a high-stakes, gritty story of forbidden romance, devastation, and taboo love that knows no bounds.</p> <p>She's barely legal.</p> <p>Under my protection.</p> <p>Fully off-limits.</p> <p>But all mine.</p> <p>Priceless is a stand-alone spin-off from The Wicked Doms series.</p> <p><b>Please note</b>: this dark romance contains mild dubious consent, elements of violence, and kinky, sexual scenes. If such subject matters offend you, please do not listen. </p>"; 
